==History==
*27/02/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Finx could be unlocked early as a bundle for $19.99.|Change=Neutral}}
**{{Balance|Content=Finx became available to play in the [[Training Cave]].|Change=Neutral}}
**{{Balance|Content=The Jurassic Finx skin was added. It was featured as a Misc skin.|Change=Neutral}}
*06/03/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Finx became available in the Starr Road.|Change=Neutral}}
*27/03/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Finx's movement speed was increased to 770 (from 720).|Change=Buff}}
**{{Balance|Content=Finx's reload time was decreased to 1.3 seconds (from 1.6).|Change=Buff}}
*23/04/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Finx's Super now autoaims at himself instead of at enemies.|Change=Neutral}}
**{{Balance|Content=Finx's True Silver and True Gold skins were added.|Change=Neutral}}
*01/05/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Finx's Wasabi Power was added for a limited time.|Change=Neutral}}
*30/05/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Finx's Wasabi Power was removed from the game.|Change=Neutral}}
*05/06/25:
**{{Balance|Content=The Mecha, Mecha Chief, and Crimson Tyfinx Finx skins were added. They were featured as Kaiju Invasion skins and Mecha Squad skins.|Change=Neutral}}
*11/09/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Finx's Temporal Traveling Hypercharge was added.|Change=Neutral}}
*28/10/25:
**{{Balance|Content=Finx's Hieroglyph Halt Star Power reload speed reduction was decreased to 25% (from 30%).|Change=Nerf}}
**{{Balance|Content=Finx's Temporal Traveling Hypercharge multiplier was decreased to 30% (from 35%).|Change=Nerf}}
**{{Balance|Content=All Hypercharges now give a 5% damage boost, decreasing Finx's Temporal Traveling Hypercharge damage boost from 15%.|Change=Nerf}}
*16/12/25:
**{{Balance|Buff|Finx's health was increased to 3700 (from 3600).}}
*25/02/26:
**{{Balance|Buff|Finx's No Escape Gadget now affects all projectiles.}}
*22/04/26:
**{{Balance|Buff|Finx's level up reload speed boost was increased to 3% (from 2%) in [[Brawl Arena]].}}
*07/05/26:
**{{Balance|Neutral|The Void Master Finx skin was added. It was featured as a Starr Patrol skin.}}
*01/09/26:
**{{Balance|Neutral|Every Brawler's movement speed was increased, increasing Finx's movement speed to 800 (from 770).}}
*03/11/26:
**{{Balance|Neutral|Fixed a server crash caused by Finx's Back to the Finxture Gadget in [[Brawl Ball]].}}

